    "name": "BookNook Cafe API",
    "description": "Postman collection for BookNook Cafe backend system (Backend Development Fundamentals group assignment). Demonstrates Games CRUD, Guests management, Bookings with SQL JOIN, and the Special Return Flow Twist.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
